<title>USA: Thermo Power says in $5 mln share buy-back.</title>
<headline>Thermo Power says in $5 mln share buy-back.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thermo Power Corp said Monday it directors had authorized through March 17, 1998 the repurchase in the open market of up to $5 million of the company's common stock, or in negotiated transactions.</p>
<p>Thermo Power will repurchase these securities when they are available at prices the company considers attractive.</p>
<p>Thermo Power is a public subsidiary of Thermo Electron Corp.</p>
